          Profile Summary
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-200 leading-relaxed">
          A technical product leader and hands-on builder with over 7 years of experience designing and delivering multi-factor authentication (2FA / PSD2 SCA), microservice API platforms, design systems, and high-traffic self-service digital products. Thrives on complex socio-technical problems, collaborating across engineering, UX, and commercial functions to deliver measurable outcomes. Experienced across the full technology spectrum—Consultant, Test Engineer, Business Analyst, Product Owner, and senior Product Manager—most recently leading a Product and UX team responsible for strategy and delivery across the homeowner customer segment.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Work Experience -->
      <section class="space-y-element">
        <h2 class="type-eyebrow border-b border-default pb-2">
          Work Experience
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-entry">
          <!-- Role 1: Product Manager @ Clarion -->
          <div class="space-y-micro">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between gap-1">
              <div>
                <h3 class="type-h4">Product Manager</h3>
                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
                  Clarion Housing Group <span class="text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500 font-normal">• London, UK</span>
                </p>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 shrink-0">06/2024 – 03/2026</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm italic text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">
              Responsible for strategy, roadmap, and delivery across all homeowner customer products, managing a cross-functional Product &amp; UX team post-restructure.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-micro text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-200">
              <li>Led the adoption of agile ways of working between Product and Software Engineering following an organisational restructure.</li>
              <li>Directed the greenfield re-platforming of the corporate website serving <strong>~35,000 monthly viewers</strong>.</li>
              <li>Implemented a greenfield design system in close collaboration with the Lead UX/UI Designer and website engineering pod.</li>
              <li>Delivered a regulatory-compliant self-service product for Shared Owner customer repairs.</li>
              <li>Delivered online staircasing customer journeys, enabling an estimated <strong>~£3m per annum</strong> in revenue.</li>
              <li>Led initial technical and domain discovery for a new enterprise asset data model spanning <strong>~125,000 properties</strong> as part of long-term organisational strategy.</li>
              <li>Renegotiated external agency contracts, achieving recurring cost savings of <strong>~£40,000 per month</strong> (£480k/yr).</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Role 2: Digital Business Analyst @ Clarion -->
          <div class="space-y-micro">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between gap-1">
              <div>
                <h3 class="type-h4">Digital Business Analyst</h3>
                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
                  Clarion Housing Group <span class="text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500 font-normal">• London, UK</span>
                </p>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 shrink-0">08/2021 – 06/2024</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-micro text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-200">
              <li>Launched the corporate website, attracting <strong>35,000 monthly viewers</strong>.</li>
              <li>Improved the online self-service repairs product conversion from <strong>under 10% to over 25%</strong> of all eligible repairs.</li>
              <li>Delivered automated self-service account unlock, eliminating <strong>~100 inbound support calls per month</strong>.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Role 3: Consultant @ Wipro / Lloyds Banking Group -->
