            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between gap-1">
              <div>
                <h3 class="type-h4">Consultant</h3>
                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
                  Wipro <span class="text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500 font-normal">• London, UK</span>
                </p>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 shrink-0">09/2017 – 06/2021</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm italic text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">
              Consulted across high-scale Financial Services digital transformation programmes with <strong>Lloyds Banking Group</strong>:
            </p>

            <div class="pl-4 border-l-2 border-default space-y-entry">
              <!-- Sub-role: BA @ Lloyds -->
              <div class="space-y-micro">
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between gap-1">
                  <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
                    Business Analyst (Product Owner &amp; Scrum Master) — <span class="font-medium text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">Lloyds Banking Group</span>
                  </h4>
                  <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 shrink-0">02/2019 – 06/2021</span>
                </div>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-micro text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-200">
                  <li>Undertook responsibilities of Product Owner and Scrum Master across an agile delivery squad.</li>
                  <li>Delivered mobile app 2FA microservice API platform for debit cards MVP, achieving <strong>PSD2 SCA compliance</strong> and an estimated reduction of <strong>~9,000 inbound calls per month</strong>.</li>
                  <li>Delivered telephony authentication enhancements, saving <strong>~£4.5m per annum</strong> and reducing inbound call contacts by <strong>1.6m per month</strong>.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <!-- Sub-role: Test Engineer @ Lloyds -->
              <div class="space-y-micro">
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between gap-1">
                  <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
                    Test Engineer — <span class="font-medium text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">Lloyds Banking Group</span>
                  </h4>
                  <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 shrink-0">01/2018 – 02/2019</span>
                </div>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-micro text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-200">
                  <li>Enabled 2FA authentication via the mobile banking app for PSD2 SCA compliance, driving run-cost savings of <strong>~£2m per month</strong>.</li>
                  <li>Simplified customer payment management and internet banking access workflows, delivering call-centre efficiency improvements of <strong>~17.5 FTE</strong>.</li>
                  <li>Enabled mobile app 2FA for payment authorisation, resulting in <strong>~£150,000 per annum</strong> in savings.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Personal Engineering & Product Projects -->
      <section class="space-y-element">
        <h2 class="type-eyebrow border-b border-default pb-2">
