            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-200">
              Authored the PRD and built a zero-friction TfL hybrid commute calculator (React 18, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS) comparing Contactless PAYG daily caps against Monthly Travelcards across Zones 1–6, featuring Railcard off-peak discounting, dynamic break-even rules, and URL/Slack sharing.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-micro">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
                <a
